{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mountain and The Moron is a 3D Rage Platformer about a Uncle who is down on his luck, and watches a podcast telling him to &quot;Climb a mountain to become Enlightened&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/3a8835373efea0b8d0907151785ed0a4.avif?t=1759187634\" width=666 height=375 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Located near the city of Uncleville, Mount Onkle, a previous attraction for the city. After years of neglect, the mountain's platforms are falling apart, making the mountain very dangerous. It has yet to claim a life, so don't be the first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/db139c4e89c192fcc1f1c652a53caf0a.avif?t=1759187634\" width=267 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Uncle Dagobert, a local Uncle with no climbing experience. You will try and fail to reach the top of the mountain. You are &quot;assisted&quot; by other strange characters who watch and record you trying to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--FEATURES</strong>--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 challenging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modifiers that change up you experience in fun and unique ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdolls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret codes that add fun Easter eggs to the game<br>Difficult platforming in risky spots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built in timer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made a student project :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-RasberryPi</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Peaked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/d79179c6f764ccfd3be76235cdad65d074800cf5.jpg"},{"name":"Quick and Easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/e9906d9a00ed8cf5375b1bf9a68d327b4fa4792f.jpg"},{"name":"Onkel Would Be Proud","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/3290a437ab42ff75995e219fb640db7df3ebfd36.jpg"},{"name":"I give up...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/02d7177d728010110e1ea5b9056af1d464269d1c.jpg"},{"name":"Wacky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/fef47a25220c1d09957bf1d34c9cadd233d8c989.jpg"},{"name":"Winner, Winner, Chicken Dinner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/480867b8f39643fcdb4e9a347154052956e4cbd2.jpg"},{"name":"Livin' on the edge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/eee538f3c857ee6f07f16202eb973d75790581cf.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/f2a50cfb5392ef289e67105766f2c1e3f41893c4.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/0b61258818d15c23743c0dd42750d6365e960445.jpg"},{"name":"Platinum Rank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704970/91914d2f4a10ec9eff1683de6fc5867f91a4dc2c.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704970?t=1759187634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704970?t=1759187634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/35f89fdd228742acd4abb2a51c993b318c57231a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759187634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/35f89fdd228742acd4abb2a51c993b318c57231a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759187634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mountain and The Moron is a 3D Rage Platformer about a Uncle who is down on his luck, and watches a podcast telling him to &quot;Climb a mountain to become Enlightened&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/3a8835373efea0b8d0907151785ed0a4.avif?t=1759187634\" width=666 height=375 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Located near the city of Uncleville, Mount Onkle, a previous attraction for the city. After years of neglect, the mountain's platforms are falling apart, making the mountain very dangerous. It has yet to claim a life, so don't be the first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/db139c4e89c192fcc1f1c652a53caf0a.avif?t=1759187634\" width=267 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Uncle Dagobert, a local Uncle with no climbing experience. You will try and fail to reach the top of the mountain. You are &quot;assisted&quot; by other strange characters who watch and record you trying to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--FEATURES</strong>--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 challenging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modifiers that change up you experience in fun and unique ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdolls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret codes that add fun Easter eggs to the game<br>Difficult platforming in risky spots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built in timer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made a student project :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-RasberryPi</p>","developers":["RasberryPi"],"dlc":[3860700],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/477890f92e9d0f578beb7ffc4520450494fae16f/header.jpg?t=1759187634","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3704970/882850/c678e3c45fc44af6bbed6a2d1e8eb333d7d296b9/1750425829/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746235452","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3704970/882850/c678e3c45fc44af6bbed6a2d1e8eb333d7d296b9/1750425829/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746235452","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3704970/882850/c678e3c45fc44af6bbed6a2d1e8eb333d7d296b9/1750425829/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746235452","id":257134081,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134081/94f2d1f0f04ee5c1ec4ecf400abc4218d3fccb31/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746235452"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3704970/879002/85d83e6245c4a1208ac918b5428d284